	<content contentuid="hc48051c4g9c9fg4df8g9cbcg760563dc63d0" version="1">영향을 받은 대상은 &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;에 &lt;LSTag Tooltip="Vulnerable"&gt;취약&lt;/LSTag&gt;해집니다.</content>
